# The image runs services/, packages/, db/, scripts/ and apps/web/dist -- nothing else the
# build context carries should reach the daemon: local state, secrets, tests and everything
# the dev setup needs but a deploy does not (PL-051).
.git
.gitignore
.venv
venv
node_modules
**/node_modules
.cache
.worktrees
.data
private/
internal/
tests/
fixtures/
.env
.env.*
**/.env
process_lens.egg-info/
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
apps/extension
apps/demo-crm
infra
tools
docker-compose.yml
